 responsible for the entire northern region and in 2010 established a separate department for the nationwide program.","wpu":"Nordnorsk Kunstmuseum","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Nordnorsk_Kunstmuseum_Troms%C3%B8.jpg/960px-Nordnorsk_Kunstmuseum_Troms%C3%B8.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Tromsø Cathedral","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":69.648747,"lo":18.956775,"d":127,"h":"Jun-Aug: Mo-Fr 12:00-17:00","wp":"no:Tromsø domkirke","ds":"Tromsø Cathedral (Norwegian: Tromsø domkirke) is a cathedral of the Church of Norway located in the city of Tromsø in Tromsø Municipality in Troms county, Norway. The cathedral is the church for the Tromsø Domkirkens parish. It is the headquarters for the Tromsø domprosti (arch-deanery) and the Diocese of Nord-Hålogaland.","wpu":"Tromsø Cathedral","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/NOR-2016-Troms%C3%B8-Troms%C3%B8_Cathedral.jpg/960px-NOR-2016-Troms%C3%B8-Troms%C3%B8_Cathedral.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Richard With","g":"sights","k":"monument","la":69.648317,"lo":18.957148,"d":133},{"n":"Magic Ice","g":"sights","k":"museum","la":69.647518,"lo":18.959222,"d":167},{"n":"Krane Galleri & Rammeverksted","g":"sights","k":"gallery","la":69.650322,"lo":18.956396,"d":202,"h":"Mo-Fr 10:00-17:00; Sa 10:00-16:00 off"},{"n":"Street Art","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":69.647719,"lo":18.956031,"d":209},{"n":"Enter Adventures","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":69.64822,"lo":18.952509,"d":302},{"n":"Vår Frue kirke","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":69.651679,"lo":18.956892,"d":321},{"n":"Smarthotel Tromsø","g":"sights","k":"hotel","la":69.648924,"lo":18.951404,"d":332,"w":"https://smarthotel.no/en/tromso","ph":"+47 41 53 65 00","wifi":1},{"n":"Tromso Coco Apartments","g":"sights","k":"hostel","la":69.648686,"lo":18.951108,"d":345,"w":"https://www.tromsococoapartments.com/","wifi":1},{"n